<body>

<h4>About Exceedances</h4>
<p>Exceedances are measurements that did not meet their threshold for water quality. Some water quality parameters have thresholds that indicate "good" water quality and others do not.</p>

<p>If exceedances occurred for a combination of inputs (park, site, parameter), this page will return a text summary of those measurements, a bar chart showing exceedances for each year of measurements, and a table of exceedances.</p>
    
<h4>Controls</h4>
<ul>
  <li><b>Hide/Show Figure</b> Toggle to collapse the exceedances bar chart.</li>
</ul>

<p>You can download the exceedances bar chart in .png format by mousing over the graph and then clicking the camera icon.</p>
  
</body>
</html>